Voting Unit (Unit A):
Included: All Staking Engineers, GIS Technician, Energy Services Technicians, and Energy Services Coordinators; 

Excluded: All other employees, confidential employees, guards and supervisors as defined by Act.

If a majority of valid ballots are cast for IBEW Local 1593, they will be taken to have indicated the employees’ desire to be included in the existing employee unit, consisting of lineworkers and meter technicians, among other classifications,  currently represented by the incumbent Union. If a majority of valid ballots are not cast for representation, they will be taken to have indicated the employees’ desire to remain unrepresented.
